"Do you believe god(s) exist(s)?"
agnostic theist: "Yes"
non-agnostic theist: "Yes" [is sure one or more do]
agnostic atheist: "No"
non-agnostic atheist: "No" [is sure none do]


"Does god exist?"
agnostic theist: "I don't know" [but believes 1 or more exist]
non-agnostic theist: "Yes" [also believes 1 or more exist]
agnostic atheist: "I don't know" [but does not believe they do]
non-agnostic atheist: "No" [and believes they do not]

'non-agnostic' used rather than 'gnostic' to remove possible 
confusion over Gnostics.

